# Functional

1. Sign-up (done), sign-in (done), reset-password (done),
2. Edit,get profile (done).
3. Channel: create-channel, get-channel-list, delete-channel (done)

4. Start group chats (limit 100 users) (done)
5. Send-receive messages (done)
6. Send/receive media
7. Access messages after they've been offline (done)
8. Ack offline(done) and online (done) message.

9. Heartbeat / Ping-Pong Keep WebSocket alive, detect disconnects
10. Last Active / Online Status Show when user was last online
11. Typing Indicator Real-time feedback (handled by FE)
12. Media Sharing (S3 Presigned URLs) Images, videos, files

13. Audio/Video calling.

# Non-Functional

1. Delivered with low-latency, < 500ms
2. Guarantee delivery of messages
3. Billions of users, high throughput
4. Messages not stored unnecessarily
5. Fault-tolerant

# Core entity

1. Users
2. Chats (2-100 users)
3. Messages
4. Clients (a user might have multiple devices)

# Commands

## Sent

- createChat
- sendMessage
- createAttachment
- modifyParticipants

## Received

- newMessage
- chatUpdate
